      details:[['Find the main sections','Pages 1–3 contain abstract, background, methods, schedule and baseline characteristics; pages 4–8 contain donors, manufacturing, outcomes, curves, assays, adverse events and mechanism; pages 9–10 contain discussion, governance and references.'],['Bibliographic provenance','Wong CH et al., Cytotherapy 28 (2026), article 102885; DOI 10.1016/j.jcyt.2026.102885. The paper states received 14 February 2026 and accepted 9 April 2026. The acceptance date is not asserted as its publication date.'],['Verification boundaries','Only reference 15, the 2013 spironolactone primary article, has the status “Primary full text independently checked.” All other numbered citations are “Cited by source; not independently revalidated.” The trial registry was checked separately and is not an additional numbered reference. Do not infer unprinted trial designs or clinical proof from a mechanistic title.'],['Keep the verdict limited','An independent AI medical-accuracy critique is part of the build review, not a clinical approval board, regulatory certification or sign-off by a pediatric oncologist. Open paper discrepancies remain visible.'],['Private, local source handling','The source PDF and rendered pages stay in this local artifact. Nothing here is automatically uploaded or published. Original article rights and its personal-use notices remain intact. Publishing the embedded article would require an appropriate right to redistribute it.']],
